{"title":"Lady Liberty of the Pacific","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/917782550/0/marginalrevolution~Lady-Liberty-of-the-Pacific.html","date":1746465464000,"content":"<p>Instead of re-opening Alcatraz as super-max prison we should build a statue to America. I suggest “Lady Liberty of the Pacific”. The spirit of Columbia ala John Gast’s American Progress carrying a welcoming beacon-lamp in her raised right hand and a coiled fibre-optic cable in her left representing Bay Area technology.</p>\r\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/PacificLiberty.jpg\" width=\"722\" height=\"1083\" srcset=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/PacificLiberty.jpg 1024w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/PacificLiberty-200x300.jpg 200w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/PacificLiberty-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://marginalrevolution.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/PacificLiberty-768x1152.jpg 768w\" /></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/05/lady-liberty-of-the-pacific.html\">Lady Liberty of the Pacific</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/917782550/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/917782550/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/917782550/marginalrevolution,https%3a%2f%2fmarginalrevolution.com%2fwp-content%2fuploads%2f2025%2f05%2fPacificLiberty.jpg\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/917782550/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://asset